WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:14.355
One day a husband and wife decided to make a gingerbread cookie.

2
00:00:14.356 --> 00:00:18.550
They cut the dough and baked it.

3
00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:23.552
When it was ready, they decorated its face with candy.

4
00:00:23.553 --> 00:00:28.561
"There!" The woman smiled. "He almost looks real."

5
00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:32.806
Her husband nodded. "He sure does."

6
00:00:32.807 --> 00:00:37.168
To their surprise, the cookie suddenly jumped up.

7
00:00:37.169 --> 00:00:39.840
He ran out the door.

8
00:00:39.841 --> 00:00:43.856
The couple ran after him. "Come back!"

9
00:00:43.857 --> 00:00:47.760
The cookie just laughed and ran faster.

10
00:00:47.761 --> 00:00:50.053
"Run, run, as fast as you can!

11
00:00:50.054 --> 00:00:54.988
You can't catch me. I'm the gingerbread man."

12
00:00:54.989 --> 00:00:58.344
Soon the cookie ran past a dog.

13
00:00:58.345 --> 00:01:04.697
The dog barked. "Mmm! I'm going to eat you!"

14
00:01:04.698 --> 00:01:07.815
The cookie laughed.

15
00:01:07.816 --> 00:01:10.475
"Run, run as fast as you can!

16
00:01:10.476 --> 00:01:14.866
You can't catch me. I'm the gingerbread man."

17
00:01:14.867 --> 00:01:20.004
The dog ran after the cookie, but the cookie ran faster.

18
00:01:20.005 --> 00:01:23.408
Soon the cookie ran past a child.

19
00:01:23.409 --> 00:01:28.146
"Mmm!" the child said. "I'm going to eat you!"

20
00:01:28.147 --> 00:01:30.944
The cookie laughed.

21
00:01:30.945 --> 00:01:33.531
"Run, run as fast as you can!

22
00:01:33.532 --> 00:01:36.712
You can't catch me. I'm the gingerbread man."

23
00:01:36.713 --> 00:01:41.412
The child ran after the cookie, but the cookie ran faster.

24
00:01:41.413 --> 00:01:44.446
Soon the cookie ran past a cow.

25
00:01:44.447 --> 00:01:53.813
The cow mooed. "Mmm! I'm going to eat you!"

26
00:01:53.814 --> 00:01:56.755
The cookie laughed.

27
00:01:56.756 --> 00:01:59.449
"Run, run, as fast as you can!

28
00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:05.605
You can't catch me. I'm the gingerbread man."

29
00:02:05.606 --> 00:02:09.439
The cookie ran until he reached a river.

30
00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:13.190
"Uh-oh!" he said. "I can't swim!"

31
00:02:13.191 --> 00:02:17.938
"Do you want to cross the river?" someone asked.

32
00:02:17.939 --> 00:02:22.575
The cookie spun around. A fox stood nearby.

33
00:02:22.576 --> 00:02:25.918
"Oh yes!" the gingerbread man said.

34
00:02:25.919 --> 00:02:27.842
"Can you help me?"

35
00:02:27.843 --> 00:02:30.751
"Sure," the fox said.

36
00:02:30.752 --> 00:02:35.585
"Jump on my tail. I'll take you to the other side."

37
00:02:35.586 --> 00:02:40.551
"Great!" The cookie jumped onto the fox's tail.

38
00:02:40.552 --> 00:02:43.767
The fox started across the river.

39
00:02:43.768 --> 00:02:46.386
"Hmm," she said.

40
00:02:46.387 --> 00:02:48.969
"The water is getting deep.

41
00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:54.318
Why don't you climb onto my back?"

42
00:02:54.319 --> 00:02:56.922
The fox kept swimming.

43
00:02:56.923 --> 00:02:59.638
"The water is getting even deeper.

44
00:02:59.639 --> 00:03:03.382
Why don't you climb onto my nose?"

45
00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:09.496
"Okay," the cookie said. "Thanks for keeping me so safe."

46
00:03:09.497 --> 00:03:12.876
"No problem," the fox said.

47
00:03:12.877 --> 00:03:20.559
Then . . . she gobbled up the cookie in one bite! Snap!

48
00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:23.759
At last everyone reached the river.

49
00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:29.278
"The gingerbread man is gone!" the child said sadly.

50
00:03:29.279 --> 00:03:31.495
The husband nodded.

51
00:03:31.496 --> 00:03:33.408
But the wife smiled.

52
00:03:33.409 --> 00:03:37.436
"Come home with us. We'll make another gingerbread man!"

53
00:03:37.437 --> 00:03:40.900
So everyone went home with the husband and wife.

54
00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:43.860
Together they made another gingerbread man.

55
00:03:43.861 --> 00:03:47.921
And this one was delicious!

